<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes double-precision floating point quaternion type with various precision in term of ULPs.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_quaternion__double__precision_8hpp">glm/ext/quaternion_double_precision.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>
</section>
